        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86655CCKSMK, Select Smooth Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Select Cabinet Knob is perfect for modern homes. This kitchen cabinet knob is 1-1/4 inches in diameter with a 1 inch projection the stem and knob top are mix-and-match so you can choose a finish combination that you love--whether that be matching or contrasting finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8665-Specifications.gif?v=1704354766\" width=\"599\" height=\"279\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Select Cabinet Knob Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Select Smooth Conical Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmtek proudly announces the BRAND NEW SATIN COPPER FINISH with this kitchen cabinet knob design.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86655-CCK-SMK-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354766\" width=\"600\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
